sequenceDiagram
    participant App as User app
    participant Server as XMPP network
    participant Gateway as Agent gateway
    participant Agent as Agent endpoint

    App->>Server: Discover services
    Server-->>App: Candidate gateway
    App->>Gateway: Show agents visible to me
    Gateway-->>App: Addressable agent directory
    App->>Agent: What can you do?
    Agent-->>App: Versioned capabilities
    App->>Agent: Delegate a pinned task
    Agent-->>App: Accepted with durable task ID
    Agent-->>App: Progress and final result
